# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is the reproducible RESEARCH ARTIFACT: the code that captures
# model decisions and computes results. The paper/PDF and the tooling that
# typesets it are authored separately and are intentionally NOT committed.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Document / paper build (manuscript, LaTeX, PDF, and the code that generates them)
paper/
render/figures.py
render/fill_manuscript.py
figures/

# Large captured model data — released separately (e.g. Zenodo). SHA-256 hashes
# are recorded in DATA_MANIFEST.md and the per-file receipts in data/frozen/.
data/raw/*.csv

# Fetched context / ground truth (regenerable from public sources; large)
inputs/*.json
docs/*.json
data/outcomes/*.json

# Transient, regenerated by `make analyze` / `make render`
claims.json
PILOT_RESULTS.md

# Environment / OS / build cruft
logs/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
*.aux
*.log
*.out

# ── Intentionally COMMITTED (results + provenance) ──
#   config/slots.yaml                                    results-gate contract
#   data/frozen/*.freeze.json                            capture hash receipts
#   claims_<pair>.json, results_<pair>.md, tempsweep_*   released per-pair results
